image distortion on projector across multiple devices dear customer support team,

i am reaching out to request help regarding a problem encountered during a recent client presentation. the projected images showed considerable distortion when connected to various devices using different cables. despite trying multiple troubleshooting methods, the issue persisted, preventing a smooth presentation.

for context, the distortion was consistently observed across different devices, including laptops and tablets, all from a single source. i attempted to change the cables,

return authorization request dear customer support team,

i hope this message reaches you well. i am reaching out to inquire about the procedure for returning a recently purchased item from your store. unfortunately, the product did not meet my expectations due to certain issues, and i would like to understand the steps involved in initiating a return.

could you please provide comprehensive details regarding your return policy, including any deadlines, the conditions the product must satisfy, and whether specific documentation or original packaging needs to be included? additionally, i would appreciate any further information needed.
